 end="24.768">and</span> <span begin="24.768" end="24.992">your</span> <span begin="24.992" end="25.422">eyes</span> <span begin="25.422" end="25.638">are</span> <span begin="25.638" end="25.939">red,</span> <span begin="25.939" end="26.187">your</span> <span begin="26.187" end="26.638">soul</span> <span begin="26.638" end="27.064">is</span> <span begin="27.213" end="27.569">gone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见你在颤抖 双眼通红 你的灵魂已然消逝</span></p><p begin="27.706" end="30.053" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.706" end="28.055">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="28.055" end="28.271">out</span> <span begin="28.271" end="28.589">of</span> <span begin="28.589" end="28.887">breath,</span> <span begin="28.887" end="29.154">tik-</span><span begin="29.154" end="29.421">tok,</span> <span begin="29.421" end="29.706">tik-</span><span begin="29.706" end="30.053">tok</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你喘不过气 滴答 滴答</span></p><p begin="30.053" end="33.107" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.053" end="30.316">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="30.316" end="30.847">almost</span> <span begin="30.847" end="31.503">out</span> <span begin="31.503" end="31.751">of</span> <span begin="31.751" end="33.107">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的时间所剩无几</span></p><p begin="33.629" end="36.713" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.629" end="34.509">Yeah,</span> <span begin="35.157" end="35.440">oh</span> <span begin="35.440" end="36.713">yeah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耶 哦 耶</span></p><p begin="36.828" end="41.361" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.828" end="37.428">Because</span> <span begin="37.428" end="37.729">at</span> <span begin="37.729" end="38.295">midnight,</span> <span begin="38.295" end="38.580">there&apos;s</span> <span begin="38.580" end="38.828">a</span> <span begin="38.828" end="39.129">change</span> <span begin="39.129" end="39.444">in</span> <span begin="39.444" end="39.820">you</span> <span begin="39.820" end="40.073">that</span> <span begin="40.073" end="40.447">I</span> <span begin="40.447" end="40.825">have</span> <span begin="40.825" end="41.361">heard</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为午夜时分 我听说你身上会发生变化</span></p><p begin="41.470" end="45.812" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.470" end="41.726">You&apos;ve</span> <span begin="41.726" end="41.979">kept</span> <span begin="41.979" end="42.209">this</span> <span begin="42.209" end="42.793">secret</span> <span begin="42.793" end="43.059">for</span> <span begin="43.059" end="43.409">so</span> <span begin="43.409" end="43.691">long,</span> <span begin="43.691" end="43.958">you</span> <span begin="43.958" end="44.625">whisper,</span> <span begin="44.625" end="44.974">and</span> <span begin="44.974" end="45.259">it</span> <span begin="45.438" end="45.812">burns</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你保守这个秘密已久 你低语着 秘密灼烧着你</span></p><p begin="45.945" end="48.217" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.945" end="46.302">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="46.302" end="46.550">out</span> <span begin="46.550" end="46.817">of</span> <span begin="46.817" end="47.084">breath,</span> <span begin="47.084" end="47.417">tik-</span><span begin="47.417" end="47.700">tok,</span> <span begin="47.700" end="47.969">tik-</span><span begin="47.969" end="48.217">tok</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你喘不过气 滴答 滴答</span></p><p begin="48.217" end="51.828" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.217" end="48.534">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="48.534" end="49.052">almost</span> <span begin="49.052" end="49.645">out</span> <span begin="49.895" end="50.389">of</span> <span begin="50.389" end="51.828">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的时间所剩无几</span></p></div><div begin="55.128" end="1:10.196" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="55.128" end="59.550" itunes:key="L10" ttm